graph TD
    A[Vesicle Formation] --> B{Traffic Direction?}
    B -->|Secretory| C[ER to Golgi]
    B -->|Endocytic| D[Plasma Membrane]
    B -->|Retrograde| E[Golgi to ER]
    
    C --> F[COPII Coated Vesicle]
    F --> G[Golgi Cisternae]
    G --> H[Golgi Processing]
    H --> I[Secretory Vesicle]
    I --> J[Exocytosis]
    J --> K[Secretion Complete]
    
    D --> L[Clathrin Coated Vesicle]
    L --> M[Early Endosome]
    M --> N[Endosome Sorting]
    N --> O[Lysosome Delivery]
    O --> P[Endocytosis Complete]
    
    E --> Q[COPI Coated Vesicle]
    Q --> R[ER Retrieval]
    R --> S[Retrograde Traffic Complete]
    
    %% Regulation
    K --> T[Secretion Status]
    P --> U[Endocytosis Status]
    S --> V[Retrograde Status]
    T --> W{Membrane Balance?}
    U --> W
    V --> W
    W -->|Normal| X[Traffic Inhibition]
    W -->|Imbalanced| Y[Traffic Activation]
    
    %% Key proteins
    Z[COPII] --> F
    AA[Clathrin] --> L
    BB[COPI] --> Q
    CC[SNARE Proteins] --> J
    DD[Rab GTPases] --> N
    EE[Adaptor Proteins] --> L
    FF[Golgi Enzymes] --> H
    
